  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Build 772\nThis is probably old behavior, but it is much more relevant now that we have smaller player-capped cross-platform worlds.\n\nIf you join on someone in a full instance, it allows you to try to join, but then you blackscreen for a while, and eventually get sent to a new empty instance of that world.  There is not any indication of what happened, which is very confusing to new users and feels like a bug/crash.",
